{"entries":[{"id":"openai-deep-research","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Introducing deep research","titleZh":"深度研究功能介绍","published":"2025-02-02T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1738454400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-deep-research/","image":"","summary":"Deep research now supports MCP/app connections, trusted site restrictions, real-time progress tracking, and visual browsing, with increased monthly query limits across all tiers.","summaryZh":"深度研究现在支持连接 MCP 或应用、限制可信网站、实时进度追踪和可视化浏览，并提高了所有用户等级的月度查询次数。"},{"id":"openai-computer-using-agent","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Computer-Using Agent","titleZh":"计算机使用代理","published":"2025-01-23T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1737590400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-computer-using-agent/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/f4eb213e22e51861.webp","summary":"Computer-Using Agent (CUA) combines GPT-4o's vision with reinforcement learning to interact with GUIs like humans, enabling flexible digital task execution without APIs.","summaryZh":"计算机使用代理（CUA）结合 GPT-4o 的视觉能力和强化学习，像人类一样与图形用户界面交互，无需 API 即可灵活执行数字任务。"},{"id":"openai-deliberative-alignment","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Deliberative alignment: reasoning enables safer language models","titleZh":"审慎对齐：推理能力使语言模型更安全","published":"2024-12-20T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1734652800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-deliberative-alignment/","image":"","summary":"Deliberative alignment teaches reasoning LLMs safety specifications and explicit reasoning, achieving superior safety performance without human-labeled data.","summaryZh":"审慎对齐通过教导推理型大语言模型安全规范并显式推理，无需人工标注数据即可实现卓越的安全性能。"},{"id":"openai-learning-to-reason","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Learning to reason with LLMs","titleZh":"学习用大语言模型进行推理","published":"2024-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1726099200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-learning-to-reason/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/7145149ca85760a5.webp","summary":"OpenAI o1 achieves 89th percentile on Codeforces, top 500 in AIME, and exceeds PhD-level accuracy on GPQA.","summaryZh":"OpenAI o1 在 Codeforces 上达到 89 百分位，在 AIME 中位列全美前 500，并在 GPQA 上超越博士级准确率。"},{"id":"openai-model-spec","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Introducing the Model Spec","titleZh":"模型规范介绍","published":"2024-05-08T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1715126400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-model-spec/","image":"","summary":"OpenAI introduces the Model Spec, a framework for defining desired model behavior, with an updated version emphasizing customizability, transparency, and intellectual freedom.","summaryZh":"OpenAI 推出模型规范，定义期望的模型行为，更新版强调可定制性、透明度和智力自由。"},{"id":"openai-bio-threat-early-warning","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Building an early warning system for LLM-aided biological threat creation","titleZh":"构建针对 LLM 辅助生物威胁创建的早期预警系统","published":"2024-01-31T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1706659200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-bio-threat-early-warning/","image":"https://images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/9ee392eb-dd7a-4886-24ae168a0ad8/3b404cc679eb7d6b7c15d4de919f5c1b/increased-access.svg?w=3840&q=90","summary":"We propose an early warning system to detect and mitigate risks of LLM-aided biological threat creation.","summaryZh":"我们提出一个早期预警系统，用于检测和减轻 LLM 辅助生物威胁创建的风险。"},{"id":"openai-weak-to-strong","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Weak-to-strong generalization","titleZh":"弱到强泛化","published":"2023-12-14T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1702512000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-weak-to-strong/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/cea14f619a9d07d3.webp","summary":"Weak-to-strong generalization shows that small models can supervise large models to achieve strong performance, even on hard problems where the small model fails.","summaryZh":"弱到强泛化表明，小模型可以监督大模型实现强性能，即使在小模型失败的难题上也能正确泛化。"},{"id":"openai-frontier-risk-preparedness","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Frontier risk and preparedness","titleZh":"前沿风险与准备","published":"2023-10-26T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1698278400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-frontier-risk-preparedness/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/1d12e85d99534939.webp","summary":"To support the safety of highly-capable AI systems, we are developing our approach to catastrophic risk preparedness, including building a Preparedness team and launching a challenge.","summaryZh":"为了支持高能力 AI 系统的安全性，我们正在制定应对灾难性风险的方法，包括组建准备团队和发起挑战。"},{"id":"openai-explain-neurons","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Language models can explain neurons in language models","titleZh":"语言模型可以解释语言模型中的神经元","published":"2023-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1683590400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-explain-neurons/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/2a00f3c0126bb3a9.webp","summary":"Language models can explain neurons in language models","summaryZh":"语言模型可以解释语言模型中的神经元"},{"id":"openai-2303.08774","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"GPT-4 Technical Report","titleZh":"GPT-4 技术报告","published":"2023-03-15T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1678838400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-2303.08774/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/920718802e22df8b.webp","summary":"GPT-4 achieves human-level performance on professional and academic benchmarks, including passing a simulated bar exam in the top 10%.","summaryZh":"GPT-4 在专业和学术基准测试中达到人类水平，包括在模拟律师资格考试中进入前 10%。"},{"id":"openai-planning-for-agi","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Planning for AGI and beyond","titleZh":"规划通用人工智能及其未来","published":"2023-02-24T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1677196800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-planning-for-agi/","image":"","summary":"Our mission is to ensure that AGI benefits all of humanity.","summaryZh":"我们的使命是确保通用人工智能惠及全人类。"},{"id":"openai-2212.08751","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Point-E: A System for Generating 3D Point Clouds from Complex Prompts","titleZh":"Point-E：一种从复杂提示生成 3D 点云的系统","published":"2022-12-16T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1671148800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-2212.08751/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/7a245d8c329bcce4.webp","summary":"Point-E generates 3D point clouds from text prompts in 1-2 minutes on a single GPU, offering a practical speed-quality trade-off.","summaryZh":"Point-E 能在单个 GPU 上 1-2 分钟内从文本提示生成 3D 点云，提供了速度与质量之间的实用权衡。"},{"id":"openai-approach-to-alignment","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Our approach to alignment research","titleZh":"我们对对齐研究的方法","published":"2022-08-24T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1661299200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-approach-to-alignment/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/1eacf4fe67fffa2b.webp","summary":"Our approach to alignment research focuses on improving AI systems' ability to learn from human feedback and assist humans in evaluating AI, aiming to build a sufficiently aligned AI system that can solve all other alignment problems.","summaryZh":"我们对齐研究的方法侧重于提升 AI 系统从人类反馈中学习以及协助人类评估 AI 的能力，旨在构建一个足够对齐的 AI 系统，以解决所有其他对齐问题。"},{"id":"openai-2112.09332","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"WebGPT: Browser-assisted question-answering with human feedback","titleZh":"WebGPT：基于浏览器辅助的问答系统与人类反馈优化","published":"2021-12-17T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1639699200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/openai-2112.09332/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/3adb5547a7883199.webp","summary":"WebGPT fine-tunes GPT-3 to answer questions by browsing the web, achieving human-preferred answers 56% of the time over human demonstrators.","summaryZh":"WebGPT 通过微调 GPT-3 使其能在文本浏览器中搜索和导航网页来回答长问题，结合模仿学习和人类反馈优化答案质量，其答案在 56%的情况下比人类演示者更受青睐。"},{"id":"openai-2110.14168","sourceId":"openai","sourceName":"OpenAI","title":"Training Verifiers to Solve Math Word Problems","titleZh":"训练验证器解决数学应用题","published":"2021-10-27T